      "width": 207.35000000000002,
      "height": 178.75,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Claude, through the\nVercel AI SDK.\n\nEach layer has its OWN\ntool allowlist, so widening\none layer's permissions\ncannot widen another's.\n\nEvery call is written to an\nai_calls row: prompt version,\nmodel, tokens, cost, verdict.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Claude, through the\nVercel AI SDK.\n\nEach layer has its OWN\ntool allowlist, so widening\none layer's permissions\ncannot widen another's.\n\nEvery call is written to an\nai_calls row: prompt version,\nmodel, tokens, cost, verdict.",
